+   Intensity: <build-intensity>...</build-intensity> ramp up    <decrease-intensity>...</decrease-intensity> ease off
+   Pitch:     <higher-pitch>...</higher-pitch>    <lower-pitch>...</lower-pitch>
+   Speed:     <slow>...</slow>    <fast>...</fast>
